#   DailySleepSnapshot). Fixtures: lab-001..007, cond-001..007, allergy-001..006,
#   imm-001..003, fam-001..003 (26 fixtures that evaluated zero constraints before
#   these shapes existed), plus dailyvital-001/002, dailyactivity-001/002,
